<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="v_{\theta^*}(x_t,c,t)=v^{\mathrm{old}}(x_t,c,t)+\frac2\beta\Delta(x_t,c,t).\tag{A.20}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-137%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22v_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)%3Dv%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)%2B%5C%5Cfrac2%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5CDelta(x_t%2Cc%2Ct).%5C%5Ctag%7BA.20%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul><li>当 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-138%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha(x_t)%3D0%22%7D"></card> 或 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-139%22%2C%22code%22%3A%221%22%7D"></card> 时，由式（A.11）有 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-140%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%3D0%22%7D"></card>；直接在式（A.16）中最小化剩余的一项，仍得 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-141%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22v_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D%3Dv%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%22%7D"></card>，与式（A.20）一致。定理 3.2 得证</li></ul></section>